{
    "title": "Shippity - Package Tracker",
    "description": "Welcome to Shippity!\r\n\r\nAre you one of the millions constantly ordering items online but always wondering when they'll be delivered? Look no further...Shippity's got you covered!\r\n\r\nTracking your packages has never been so easy, or looked so good! With Shippity, we\u2019ll show you the orders you've placed online, and give you full details on where exactly your order is in the shipping process. Whether your order has just shipped, between warehouses or delivered, you'll know everything you need to know about those packages throughout the entire process.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s what you can expect from Shippity:\r\n\u2022 Connect your email and we'll track orders you've placed online.\r\n\u2022 See full details about your order including what's in the box and where it currently is in the shipping process.\r\n\u2022 Get notified any time a new order is shipped, out for delivery, delivered and everything in between.\r\n\u2022 Add your own tracking numbers to manually track orders not linked to your email.\r\n\u2022 Scan barcodes to add them to the tracking list.\r\n\r\nKnow more. Stress less. Download Shippity!\r\n\r\nLove Shippity?\r\nLeave a review and let us know what you think!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Shippity!<br><br>Are you one of the millions constantly ordering items online but always wondering when they&#39;ll be delivered? Look no further...Shippity&#39;s got you covered!<br><br>Tracking your packages has never been so easy, or looked so good! With Shippity, we\u2019ll show you the orders you&#39;ve placed online, and give you full details on where exactly your order is in the shipping process. Whether your order has just shipped, between warehouses or delivered, you&#39;ll know everything you need to know about those packages throughout the entire process.<br><br>Here\u2019s what you can expect from Shippity:<br>\u2022 Connect your email and we&#39;ll track orders you&#39;ve placed online.<br>\u2022 See full details about your order including what&#39;s in the box and where it currently is in the shipping process.<br>\u2022 Get notified any time a new order is shipped, out for delivery, delivered and everything in between.<br>\u2022 Add your own tracking numbers to manually track orders not linked to your email.<br>\u2022 Scan barcodes to add them to the tracking list.<br><br>Know more. Stress less. Download Shippity!<br><br>Love Shippity?<br>Leave a review and let us know what you think!",
